The two fit together: an app lock keeps your private apps closed, and CrookCatcher shows you who picked up the phone and tried to get in, whether that's someone at home or a thief. The photo, location and email are free. CrookCatcher has been downloaded more than 12 million times since 2014. Setup takes a few minutes: see [how to see who tried to unlock your Android phone](/blog/see-who-tried-to-unlock-your-phone).

